<h2 id='who-its-for' emoji='🎯'>🎯 Who AWeber Is (and Isn't) For</h2>

**AWeber is the right call if you're:**

- An independent fitness studio or boutique gym with a member list under 5,000 contacts
- A studio owner who wants email marketing running reliably without hiring a dedicated marketing person
- Operating on a tight budget and need a free or low-cost entry point with room to scale
- Running straightforward campaigns: welcome sequences, class promos, seasonal offers, re-engagement drips
- A studio operator who also wants to refer AWeber to peer gym owners and earn recurring passive income

**AWeber is probably not the right call if you're:**

- Running a multi-location franchise that needs deep CRM functionality and membership data in one platform
- Building complex behavioral automations based on class attendance, purchase history, or app activity
- Prioritizing cutting-edge email design with heavy personalization blocks
- Already deep in the HubSpot or ActiveCampaign ecosystem with established workflows

